silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_10_alternatives_dual_computational_sections_03_computational_algorithmic_concrete_anchor_25_SilmarilForge#silmarilforge silm:hasLongDescription "The SilmarilForge is the cross-paper forge-discipline gating Mittens into compliance with the federation pipeline. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'SilmarilForge', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
